{"duration_api_ms":113459,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":0.7716506000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46914,"cache_read_input_tokens":743413,"output_tokens":12378,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1703},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46914,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1249,"cache_read_input_tokens":77595,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1689},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":12378,"cacheReadInputTokens":743413,"cacheCreationInputTokens":46914,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7716506000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1703,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":46914,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01V5yAzimfxyozSUXZot7HNj","tool_input":{"command":"cd .theseus; sed -n '/## 4/,/## 7/p' spec/method-measurement.md; cat METHOD-CHANGELOG.md | head -40; ls proposals; cat scoreboard/packets.jsonl; echo; cat scoreboard/escapes.jsonl; echo; cat scoreboard/friction.jsonl; ls scoreboard/runs | head -50; ls queue/*"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01DukoXfTqdnUG6PV246wA3b","tool_input":{"command":"sed -n '/^## 4/,/^## 7/p' .theseus/spec/method-measurement.md"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_018Hkuq7ua8t8BpqCyVDgDvW","tool_input":{"command":"f=.theseus/audits/AUD-1.md\npython3 - \"$f\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys;p=sys.argv[1];s=open(p).read()\nfor a,b in [(\"$5.19 for the 7\",\"$6.19 for the 7\"),(\"6/9 first-review\",\"7/9 first-review\"),\n(\"17 of 17 rejection reasons say the Goal was not met (PKT-0002 ×3, 0015 ×2, 0016 ×6, 0017 ×3, 0016/0017 done records after reruns); all appear justified\",\"14 of 14 rejection reasons name an unmet Goal clause (PKT-0002 ×3, 0015 ×2, 0016 ×6, 0017 ×3); all appear justified\"),\n(\"None of the 17 rejection\",\"None of the 14 rejection\"),(\"17/17 rejections\",\"14/14 rejections\"),(\"about 3 times higher\",\"about 3 times higher in total\")]:\n    assert a in s,a; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":22,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote the audit report and four improvement proposals for PKT-0020 and committed them as `1027d91`. The acceptance check (`test -s .theseus/audits/AUD-1.md`) passes, and `theseus validate` reports 0 errors and 1 warning; I didn't look into what the warning is.\n\n**What the audit found**\n\nThe 22 scoreboard records cover 18 distinct packets: 10 done, 7 discarded, 5 blocked. No method rule touched 20 or more packets, so under the auditor rules every result is an observation, not a finding.\n\n- **Outside dependencies drive the failures.** All 7 packets that passed on the first review only needed the repository. Every first-review failure and every costed block needed something outside it: a running Document Server, the GitHub API, or a file outside the packet's target.\n- **Retrying didn't help with blockers.** In PKT-0002, PKT-0016 and PKT-0017, every rejection repeated the same blocker, and only a human or the factory could remove it. Records that ended blocked cost $7.34, which is 38% of the period's $19.44 total.\n- **Acceptance checks only test that a file exists.** In PKT-0016 the check passed while the file held no measurements. This packet's own check has the same weakness.\n- **Review worked, but it isn't cross-family.** All 14 rejections named a real unmet goal, and there were no escapes. The reviewer (`claude-opus-5-5-b`) is the same family as the executor (`claude-opus-5-5`), which goes against the cross-family rule unless pilot mode is on. I didn't check whether it is. This audit was also run by the same family, which the measurement spec advises against.\n- **Several indicators can't be computed.** `estimated`, `context_ratio`, `out_of_context_reads` and `flaky_oracle` are empty in every record, so the packet and Atlas indicators are missing. Only 3 of the 15 friction lines were written by an agent; the other 12 are lists of refused commands from the factory.\n- **Zero escapes proves little yet:** the period produced no production code, only investigation and characterisation packets.\n\n**Proposals**\n\n- **TEP-0001:** block a packet on the first rejection that names an external blocker, instead of spending two more attempts.\n- **TEP-0002:** let a packet declare the resources it needs and check them before an agent claims it. Also allow plain read commands like `cat`, `ls` and `grep` by default.\n- **TEP-0003:** require at least one acceptance command that checks the goal's actual content.\n- **TEP-0004:** fill the indicator fields, and refuse delivery until the agent has written its own friction line.\n\nThe report also lists what should not change: goal-focused review, strict targets with spawn requests, small investigation packets, and the 3-attempt limit.\n\n**What I left out**\n\n- I made no spawn requests, because everything I found is a gap in the method, not in the project.\n- I did not read the run folders in `scoreboard/runs/` or each packet's log in depth. The numbers come from `packets.jsonl` and `friction.jsonl` only.\n- Python heredocs and some `sed` commands were refused by permissions. I used the file-editing tool instead and did not work around the refusals.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas**\n\n- Record the scoreboard fields that the indicators need, otherwise audits are partly blind.\n- Plan packets that depend on outside resources separately, with a check that the resource works before an agent is sent.\n\nFiles are in `.theseus/`:\n- `audits/AUD-1.md`\n- `proposals/TEP-0001.md`\n- `proposals/TEP-0002.md`\n- `proposals/TEP-0003.md`\n- `proposals/TEP-0004.md`","ttft_ms":2612,"type":"result","duration_ms":114970,"uuid":"1e488fe8-04fe-41fb-a010-9d771dcad335","ttft_stream_ms":1562,"time_to_request_ms":914,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":226,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":26,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":561,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":9,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":18,"query_setup":4,"auto_mode_context_wait":6,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":26,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":2,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":90,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":297,"time_to_request_major_faults":11,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":217,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":141,"process_rss_mib_result":234,"process_anon_mib_result":143,"process_peak_rss_mib":239,"process_cpu_ms_turn":3059,"process_wall_ms_turn":114970,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1988,"process_wall_ms_streaming":106224,"main_stream_count":12,"main_stream_event_count":1812,"main_stream_chunk_count":1524,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":10,"cpu_ms":29,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":10,"ambient_wait_ms":10,"render_ms":2,"producers":41,"token_coun